title: 밤_1_편의점_신아산_영문
---
(I'm working a shift at a convenience store as a substitute for a friend.)
(They clearly said this location doesn't get many people and it would be even quieter at night...)
(But for some reason, I'm getting swamped with work today.)
<<play 편의점_문>>
{name()}: Yes, welcome.
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
ASan: Do you have Pukimon Bread h—
{name()}: Oh, ASan Shin?
<<show san_shock_ver2>>
<<play san_sound>>
ASan: What? It's {name()}?
ASan: Since when did you start working part-time here?
{name()}: Oh, I'm not a regular. A friend asked me to cover their shift.
<<show san_neg_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Hmph. Got my hopes up for nothing.
ASan: I was going to ask you to hide one for me when the Pukimon Bread comes in.
{name()}: Pukimon Bread..?
ASan: You don't know it? It's so famous lately that it's sold out everywhere.
ASan: I really wanted to try it.......
(Hearing ASan's story reminded me of something.)
<<choice 밤_1_편의점_신아산_긍정1_영문 "Wait, we actually have some in stock." 밤_1_편의점_신아산_부정1_영문 "Unfortunately, our store is all sold out too." true>>
(My friend said they hid a famous bread behind the counter... should I give it to ASan?)
===

title: 밤_1_편의점_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Wait, we actually have some in stock.
<<show san_smile_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Really???????
ASan: I've been to ten different convenience stores all day looking for that....
{name()}: That's a relief. 
{name()}: Actually, it belongs to my friend, but... well, I guess it's okay to give it to you.
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
ASan: What did you say??????
ASan: Is it really okay to give it to me?
{name()}: Yeah.
{name()}: Anyway, that friend doesn't even like Pukimon.
<<show san_smile_ver2>>
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: I'd be more than grateful.
ASan: I'll pay for it then.
{name()}: Sure. That'll be 4,800 won.
(Once the payment was finished, ASan left the store with the bread and a child-like smile.)
(I hope she gets the character she likes from the collectible sticker inside.)
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_1_편의점_신아산_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: Unfortunately, our store is all sold out too.
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
ASan: As expected....
ASan: I've been to ten different convenience stores all day looking for that....
ASan: I should just give up.
ASan: Thanks for letting me know.
ASan: See you at school tomorrow.
<<end>>
===